    {
      "id": "FjkhEfIPsOWwcdE9RAhOk",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 71.4467957180936,
      "y": 1440.1798344304243,
      "width": 720.4941298879208,
      "height": 481.3332184909713,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1048057773,
      "version": 1217,
      "versionNonce": 1882195588,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791051056723,
      "created": 1791035927966,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Geographic distribution\nConnection pooling\nSharding to handle 1M request/sec -> 1 Redis only do 100K rps\nRedis cluster\nRead replicas\n\nHM Get and HM Set commands for redis\ncompareAndSet(count, count - 1) -> Atomic integer feature\nGetway and rate limiter are as close to gateway ( ideally at\nsame data center)\n\nHandling race condition in redis?\nWith Lua script -> kind of lock based, so in single script all\nredis commands executed for one request at a time.\n\nQuestion?\nHow to handle dynamic rule configuration?\nAnswer: Push notification when rule changes -> store it in-\nmemory of API gateway.",
      "fontSize": 20.266661831198792,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Geographic distribution\nConnection pooling\nSharding to handle 1M request/sec -> 1 Redis only do 100K rps\nRedis cluster\nRead replicas\n\nHM Get and HM Set commands for redis\ncompareAndSet(count, count - 1) -> Atomic integer feature\nGetway and rate limiter are as close to gateway ( ideally at same data center)\n\nHandling race condition in redis?\nWith Lua script -> kind of lock based, so in single script all redis commands executed for one request at a time.\n\nQuestion?\nHow to handle dynamic rule configuration?\nAnswer: Push notification when rule changes -> store it in-memory of API gateway.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
