    {
      "id": "wsK3rYUKXy0aXltiDUVHb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 966.4289085690332,
      "y": 433.42501158784637,
      "width": 693,
      "height": 925,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0N",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1401379900,
      "version": 1037,
      "versionNonce": 650060676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791050719682,
      "created": 1791047909835,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rate limiter algorithm\n\n1. Fixed window counter.\nIssue: More requests between 2 windows.\n\n2. Sliding window log.\nSolves issue of fixed window counter\nIssue: Additional space is required\n    like head or queue\n\n3. Sliding window counter\n\nPrevious minute (1:00 1:01): 8 requests\nCurrent minute (1:01 1:01:42): 6 requests\n\nHow to decide?\n\nWe are 70% through the minute, so take 30% from previous minute\n\n6 + (30% of 8) = 8.6 (estimated requests this minute)\n\n8.6 < 10 so pass\n\nIssue: Here prediction is not accurate\n\n\n4. Leaky bucket\n\n- Proper for production\n- Issue: Additional bounded queue is needed\n\n5. Token bucker\n- Best for production\n- WindowSize, requetsPerWindow, currentTime, previousTime\n\nStore these 4 counter in redis for each userId, Ip\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rate limiter algorithm\n\n1. Fixed window counter.\nIssue: More requests between 2 windows.\n\n2. Sliding window log.\nSolves issue of fixed window counter\nIssue: Additional space is required\n    like head or queue\n\n3. Sliding window counter\n\nPrevious minute (1:00 1:01): 8 requests\nCurrent minute (1:01 1:01:42): 6 requests\n\nHow to decide?\n\nWe are 70% through the minute, so take 30% from previous minute\n\n6 + (30% of 8) = 8.6 (estimated requests this minute)\n\n8.6 < 10 so pass\n\nIssue: Here prediction is not accurate\n\n\n4. Leaky bucket\n\n- Proper for production\n- Issue: Additional bounded queue is needed\n\n5. Token bucker\n- Best for production\n- WindowSize, requetsPerWindow, currentTime, previousTime\n\nStore these 4 counter in redis for each userId, Ip\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
